    "body": "## Scope\nOwner-approved written spec + implementation plan for the first real SALVADOR production mode: `REFERENCE -> CANON EDIT`.\n\n## Owner approvals already received\n- `ОДОБРЯЮ SALVADOR V1 DESIGN`\n- `ОДОБРЯЮ SPEC #55`\n\n## Documents\n- Spec: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-26-salvador-v1-canon-reference-edit-design.md`\n- Plan: `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-08-26-salvador-v1-canon-reference-edit.md`\n\n## Current plan\n10 gated tasks:\n1. strict task contract + canon policy\n2. deployment config + side-by-side backend registry\n3. safe deterministic reference staging/preprocessing\n4. immutable canon prompt + separate SD1.5 img2img workflow\n5. ComfyUI/model preflight + submit/output validation\n6. restart-safe production provenance\n7. mocked end-to-end regression + docs\n8. independent DUNCAN QC\n9. real 4 GB local model preservation smoke\n10. explicit OWNER production activation gate\n\n## Key boundaries\n- one drawn single-character reference -> one canonized output\n- preserve identity/geometry/pose/composition; no redesign\n- `CANON > prettier output`\n- `TASK_KIND = CANON_REFERENCE_EDIT`\n- local ComfyUI / zero paid API\n- lightweight SD1.5-class baseline, denoise 0.25..0.45, long side <= 768\n- exact checkpoint remains external deployment config\n- disposable ImageInvert smoke path stays separate\n- texture/material work deferred to SALVADOR v2 `TEXTURE_PASS`\n- no automatic chat-to-local file bridge in v1\n- no ControlNet in baseline implementation; any ControlNet spike is separate\n- implementation merge != production activation\n\n## Exact branch state\nBase: `cf68c4882f84d8d0cce07f05ccc15345b913ddca`\nCurrent head: `647f8276f227f3f90b86a239b965f34c5a9c8b3e`\nChanged files: 2 (spec + plan only)\n\n## Current gate\n`PLAN_REVIEW_REQUIRED = YES`\n`IMPLEMENTATION = NO`\n`MODEL_DOWNLOAD = NO`\n`PRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO`\n\nPR remains draft until owner approves the implementation plan.",
    "changed_files": 2,
